  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-big-red-truck-v4.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "cbe15941cbb96be2848c4a1db59289e9ef4e578f3ac899390bab0be967aebac9",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4295a644405893550dbb2f29ad1c0a6b4142bd528f4c9b13af7d26bf54fd9550",
      "text": "Wukong and the\nBig Red Truck",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6b2af0dc6f6a6e726edb3457b1bb9330e4bd89e2c5bfbeda82968c1b2bb2ff3b",
      "text": "A big red truck rolled by.\n“Look at those wheels!”\nWukong’s tail went BOING!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "525cbb32bb91aef44d7ebebf68d36c69cbb3cbc4e08173062da9f39721c354a1",
      "text": "At the station, Ben waved.\n“Come and have a look!”\nWukong had\nso many questions.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "182fcece692f1611ffe8587429deaed364491d242bbce4f13237252bfd8e3c24",
      "text": "“Why the big boots?”\n“They help protect my feet.”\nWukong looked at his shoes.\n“Mine are only squeaky!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "dabbe8963c450b6da70b94dda3b0a39458c6f7597903d0528225241f96c4b9a3",
      "text": "Ben lent him a clean play hat.\nIt slipped over his eyebrows.\n“Do firefighters need eyes?”\n“Very much!” laughed Ben.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "932f4cf4971b99a835d28cea4dc95c34b985e33b19e93b5fc158f84d7362ed73",
      "text": "Ben showed his special mask.\n“It helps me breathe\nclean air.”\nHis voice sounded funny.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0864ba4e9e7457b95eee8a3c6b0f458dd88ac3088dc500298227828145dfd04a",
      "text": "“Still me!” said Ben.\nWukong waved back.\n“Hello, funny-voice Ben!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "de6344d7ed7ce1d80d7aa68aa6798d04c16dad4692d28da6c601131f1bcd459f",
      "text": "“Is that a giant noodle?”\n“A hose!” said Ben.\n“It carries water.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e48d6d9f6c3d80718406ddcc94683d672b6661c8dbf08884c70507b4f5fd1b91",
      "text": "Ben held the hose.\nWhoooosh went the water.\nOne tiny drop kissed\nWukong’s nose.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "50e5599f74914639919525bf312589a23cbd00d0822565685c1f455c108e9214",
      "text": "“And the ladder?”\n“It helps us reach up high.”\nWukong stayed down below.\nHis tail reached up.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0761a4106535ae27aa108c630d4771ff72321b6c518ce372fe1eb15c742aff7e",
      "text": "Then Ben showed an alarm.\n“Beep! Beep! Beep!”\n“That sound is a warning.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6e91f34c5df627039e730ce6b8db4b8ca8a172c238f4016ef5bb9800c585cf32",
      "text": "“If it beeps, go outside.”\nThey practiced the way out.\n“Then stay outside,” said Ben.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1ff387e7bfb73e3f9456df7068bccff923189e017e65d4f1a9d4bb36233560e2",
      "text": "They chose a meeting tree.\n“Count noses!” said Wukong.\nPigsy counted his twice.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "77376a2b434e783f14c97731a4c06d4f1c253e05fde93b75fa3dadf8b256980f",
      "text": "Wukong thanked Ben.\n“Big truck. Big job.\nBig kind heart.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f8f343ba6b817e03ff181a30139c00dffa1aa3ee125884da69e45f9ab8988e53",
      "text": "At home, his toy truck went\nwee-oo… wee-oo…\nThen quieter.\nThen… shhh.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "557b4ae3e50676a42e2e8c02e295d6701e50aaa7bc92c7a145516f42944917be",
      "text": "He tucked in his toy truck.\n“Goodnight, helpers.”\nThe whole room felt quiet.\nSo did he.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
